    "summary": "As the battle begins, you can place this unit's Teleport Homer token on the battlefield, anywhere outside the deployment zone of your opponent. If you place it, once per battle, using the [Rapid Ingress](vsdata:ability/core.rapid-ingress) Stratagem on this unit costs 0CP. As that Stratagem resolves, you have to set this unit up up to 3\" horizontally from the token and more than 8\" horizontally from every enemy model. The token is then removed.",
